.TH flood_router6 8 2026-02-07 THC IPv6 ATTACK TOOLKIT
.SH "نام (NAME)"
.B flood_router6

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
flood_router6 [-HFD] interface

Flood the local network with router advertisements.
-F/-D/-H add fragment/destination/hopbyhop header to bypass RA guard security.
